      "body": "## H-008 LINTRACK075 · PERSONAL 3K→5K continuation\n\n- Parent: H-008 3K `model_2998.pt`, SHA-256 `d9a30c8a117f69cac49c4e640500f0fa8d88de72d6c61855f1e147ea6c1912ae`\n- Reward configuration: unchanged H-008 configuration\n- Requested continuation: +2,000 iterations\n- Actual console range: global 2998–4997; exit code 0\n- Representative checkpoint: final `model_4997.pt`, SHA-256 `e6deed62c1dfff4d5bdaac4cf77ee7308f91f04f9ea6db32a8f80f3e5db922a2`\n- Environment: PERSONAL / Brev L40S. This is not OFFICIAL performance or submission evidence.\n\n## Download map\n\n- `H-008_LINTRACK075_PERSONAL_5K_DOWNLOAD.tar.gz` is the small, derived download handoff. Its single top-level directory contains only final `model_4997.pt`, matching `env.yaml`, native `report.html`, and a manifest/README.\n- `20260917-234047-h1-h008-cont2k-from-2998.tar.gz` is the immutable canonical training evidence. It retains TensorBoard, console, 21 numbered checkpoints, settings, source records, telemetry, internal `SHA256SUMS`, and validation record.\n- The canonical `.sha256` and `.metadata.json` are sidecars for that original archive.\n- `*-POSTRUN-PROVENANCE.tar.gz` is a supplementary post-run reconstruction. It helps identify the parent/final hashes but does not replace execution-time provenance.\n\n## Integrity and limitation\n\n- Canonical outer SHA-256: `b669bf1b90a67a4468e6851ab237538bbab6450144b3e4f5e9eecbfeb6777d9e`; its received sidecar and GitHub asset digest agree.\n- Internal canonical `SHA256SUMS`: 41/41 files verified.\n- Native automatic `model_best.pt` selected `model_4900.pt`; it is deliberately not the default representative here. Resume policy uses final numbered `model_4997.pt` unless a joint late-window regression is shown.\n- The run was launched through generic `issacsimz run`, so original metadata has `profile=null`, `source_checkpoint=null`, and `resume_lineage=null`; canonical `validation.json` is `WARN`. Do not upgrade this limitation through the supplementary